  "body": "## 🤖 AI-Generated Changelog\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Fixed a crash in the pure-Python resolver backend when checking hashes for sdist packages\n- Resolved incorrect resolver backend precedence when `resolver_backend` is set in `[pipenv]` configuration outside of a lock operation\n\n## Changed\n\n- The `resolver_backend` setting in `[pipenv]` is now honored consistently outside of lock operations\n- Improved resolver performance by memoizing pure-Python `find_matches` results during backtracking and caching parsed package manifests\n- Both resolver backends are now benchmarked for better performance comparison and selection\n\n---\n\n🔗 **Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/pipenv/compare/v2026.9.0...v2026.9.1\n"
